  aciklama:
  - "Y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131m G\xFCrses ne de g\xFCzel s\xF6ylemi\u015F; \"Yalan d\xFCnya,
    her \u015Fey bombo\u015F, hanc\u0131 sarho\u015F, yolcu sarho\u015F.\" Yalan
    bir d\xFCnya i\xE7in, do\u011Fru s\xF6yleyen sence de \xE7ok fazla fal uygulamas\u0131
    yok mu? (!) \u0130lac\u0131n geldi. \u015Eu anda Magnus'das\u0131n {{isim}}.
    Fincan g\xF6rsellerine resmen \"y\xFCre\u011Fin\" yans\u0131m\u0131\u015F. Ben
    de ayn\u0131 i\xE7tenlikle yorumlamaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Faca\u011F\u0131m. Dilersen
    ba\u015Flayal\u0131m."
